build/
*.o
*.log
# ...but the logs that are TEST DATA are committed. tools/test_name_screens.py
# reproduces two VERIFIED bases from a real run, and checks the refusal path
# against a synthetic one; a suite whose inputs are gitignored passes only on
# the machine that happened to produce them.
!docs/run-*.log
!tools/fixtures/*.log
tools/__pycache__/
data/text_*.json
# Dumps of the unpacked game image: large, and game-owned code.
cfc2_dump/
*.bin
# Regenerable cross-reference index (tools/build_riprefs.py).
# Not committed: it is large, derived, and goes stale when the game rewrites
# the dump -- the tool refuses to load a stale one rather than answer wrongly.
riprefs.pkl
# Claude Code's permission allowlist. Machine-specific: every entry embeds an
# absolute path to this checkout and to the Steam install, so a committed copy
# would grant nothing on another machine while looking as though it did.
.claude/
